3.3074.683The applied references do not disclose or suggest such a feature. The device shown in Figs. 41A and 98A of Abreu and the devices in the figures of Roth do not have displays that protrude from the housing on which they are attached. Rather, the displays are set into the housing. None of the embodiments of these references disclose a display that protrudes from a housing.
